# 🍽️ Restaurant Menu UI/UX Design

This project features a modern, easy-to-navigate **Restaurant Menu UI/UX design**, created for the **CODSOFT UI/UX Internship**.

---

## 🎯 Objective

Design an interactive and visually appealing digital menu for a restaurant that enhances the customer ordering experience. Key components include:
- Category-based item browsing
- Item descriptions with images
- Prices and add-to-cart functionality
- Responsive layout for mobile and tablet

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Figma  
- Adobe XD *(optional)*  
- Google Fonts  
- Material Icons

